# native-engine/gatra-native-engine.<target>.node prebuilt addons ARE
# committed on purpose (see native-engine/index.js and
# .github/workflows/native-engine.yml) — that's what lets Gatra's data<T>
# native path work on a fresh clone with no Rust toolchain installed, same
# as any other prebuilt Node native addon. Only ignore stray local-only
# build names that don't match a real platform-target tag.
native-engine/index.node
